      "content": "thanks for that. but i'm still hearing from my boss that \"staying out of it\" is the only way to protect our bottom line from the segment of users who think these taxes are just a government power grab. \n\nif i tell the board that we \"must\" support the tax to avoid being \"irrelevant,\" won't they just say I'm being biased and ignoring the actual economic risk of losing a huge chunk of our current revenue? basically, is it actually a sound business decision to take a side on a controversial policy, or is that just wishful thinking?",
